{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u201cA quiet moment beneath the sea, where I meet my own fishy friends.\u201d</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Polarium</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806010/extras/image.png?t=1749708915\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Relaxing background idle gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>\u201cPolarium grows little by little, just by staying by your side.\u201d</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806010/extras/GameScene.gif?t=1749708915\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Even while you leave the window open and focus on other tasks,<br>your fish quietly grow, and pearls slowly accumulate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Like a small aquarium by the window,<br>your ocean friends gently drift across the screen.<br>And when you return,<br>you\u2019ll find joy in the subtle changes beneath the sea.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Invite new ocean friends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>\u201cWho will come next?\u201d</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806010/extras/Spawn.gif?t=1749708915\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the depths of the sea, you can invite unique fish through the clam-shaped gate \u2014 each one with a different look every time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Patterns, colors, fins, and even expressions are all randomly generated.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The more you collect, the more your collection grows, filling your own underwater world with new friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806010/extras/Spawn2.gif?t=1749708915\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Share the love</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>\u201cThe magic of two lives coming together to create a new one.\u201d</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806010/extras/Mate.gif?t=1749708915\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When you breed two different fish,<br>you might discover rare or uniquely shaped new ones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The results of each combination are yours to uncover!<br>Enjoy the thrill of collection and the joy of experimentation, all in one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806010/extras/Mate2.gif?t=1749708915\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>The ocean keeps growing!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>\u201cYour underwater base grows slowly, but surely.\u201d</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806010/extras/Building.gif?t=1749708915\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">To collect or breed fish, you\u2019ll need special buildings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upgrade various facilities like your base, the Love Rock, and the Clam Gate to meet more fish \u2014 faster and in greater variety.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The more you upgrade, the livelier your underwater world becomes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Pearl gifts from your fish</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>\u201cLittle treasures gifted by your fish.\u201d</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806010/extras/click2.gif?t=1749708915\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Over time, your fish quietly produce pearls.<br>These pearls are a key resource used to upgrade buildings and discover rare fish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gather these precious treasures slowly and gently beneath the sea,<br>and grow your own little underwater kingdom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806010/extras/Click.gif?t=1749708915\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3806010?t=1749708915","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3806010?t=1749708915","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806010/fad8ee52f95f816d42d7acdd339b7a424b8d2cad/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749708915","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806010/fad8ee52f95f816d42d7acdd339b7a424b8d2cad/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749708915","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u201cA quiet moment beneath the sea, where I meet my own fishy friends.\u201d</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Polarium</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806010/extras/image.png?t=1749708915\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Relaxing background idle gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>\u201cPolarium grows little by little, just by staying by your side.\u201d</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806010/extras/GameScene.gif?t=1749708915\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Even while you leave the window open and focus on other tasks,<br>your fish quietly grow, and pearls slowly accumulate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Like a small aquarium by the window,<br>your ocean friends gently drift across the screen.<br>And when you return,<br>you\u2019ll find joy in the subtle changes beneath the sea.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Invite new ocean friends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>\u201cWho will come next?\u201d</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806010/extras/Spawn.gif?t=1749708915\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the depths of the sea, you can invite unique fish through the clam-shaped gate \u2014 each one with a different look every time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Patterns, colors, fins, and even expressions are all randomly generated.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The more you collect, the more your collection grows, filling your own underwater world with new friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806010/extras/Spawn2.gif?t=1749708915\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Share the love</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>\u201cThe magic of two lives coming together to create a new one.\u201d</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806010/extras/Mate.gif?t=1749708915\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When you breed two different fish,<br>you might discover rare or uniquely shaped new ones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The results of each combination are yours to uncover!<br>Enjoy the thrill of collection and the joy of experimentation, all in one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806010/extras/Mate2.gif?t=1749708915\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>The ocean keeps growing!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>\u201cYour underwater base grows slowly, but surely.\u201d</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806010/extras/Building.gif?t=1749708915\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">To collect or breed fish, you\u2019ll need special buildings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upgrade various facilities like your base, the Love Rock, and the Clam Gate to meet more fish \u2014 faster and in greater variety.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The more you upgrade, the livelier your underwater world becomes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Pearl gifts from your fish</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>\u201cLittle treasures gifted by your fish.\u201d</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806010/extras/click2.gif?t=1749708915\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Over time, your fish quietly produce pearls.<br>These pearls are a key resource used to upgrade buildings and discover rare fish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gather these precious treasures slowly and gently beneath the sea,<br>and grow your own little underwater kingdom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806010/extras/Click.gif?t=1749708915\" /></p>","developers":["Superjoy Co., Ltd."],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806010/9fef26416563e502d20f31e6c92929f7c949cd4f/header.jpg?t=1749708915","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257152750,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257152750/movie480.mp4?t=1749708911","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257152750/movie_max.mp4?t=1749708911"},"name":"Polarium gameplay preview","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257152750/385e3ce03fa155cd926112399367d2bb0bffdcbd/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1749708911","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257152750/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1749708911","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257152750/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1749708911"}}],"name":"Polarium","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core 2 Duo<br></li><li><strong>Memory: